<title>USA: Nu-West to redeem preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Nu-West to redeem preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nu-West Industries said on Friday it is redeeming all of its outstanding class A preferred shares on December 13, 1996 at $100 par value plus all accrued and unpaid dividends of $71.50.</p>
<p>Chase Mellon Shareholder Services is acting as redemption agent, the company said.</p>
<p>The value of the preferred stock outstanding could not immediately be determined.</p>
</text>
